    "Sophia 仅在可访问后端的局域网内工作。应用进入后台后不保证持续接收运行事件，重新打开时会同步最新状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sophia works only on a local network that can reach the backend. Run events may pause while the app is in the background; the latest state is synced when you reopen it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sophia 仅在可访问后端的局域网内工作。应用进入后台后不保证持续接收运行事件，重新打开时会同步最新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Token 数为本地分词器估算值，非 API 计费口径。统计页沿用 Web 端展示口径，将已记录的输出侧估算值乘以 2。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token counts are local tokenizer estimates, not API billing figures. As on the web, recorded output estimates are multiplied by 2."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Token 数为本地分词器估算值，非 API 计费口径。统计页沿用 Web 端展示口径，将已记录的输出侧估算值乘以 2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
