    "仅删除调度规则，已产生的历史运行记录会保留。此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the schedule rule will be deleted. Existing run history will be kept. This action cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
